{"name":"Awakened","hex":"#e3dae9","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"awakened","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of awaken"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having been woken up.","Aroused; alerted; activated; enlightened."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/awakened"}],"entries":[{"title":"Awakened (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Awakened is a 2013 independent supernatural horror film. It was co-written, co-directed, and co-produced by Joycelyn Engle, who also acts in the film, which stars her daughter Julianne Michelle as the lead character."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/Awakened_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awakened_(film)"},{"title":"Awakened (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Awakened is the sixth studio album by American metalcore band As I Lay Dying. It is the final album released by the band before their hiatus in 2014. The album was released on September 25, 2012, through Metal Blade Records. The album was produced by Bill Stevenson and recorded at The Blasting Room in Fort Collins, Colorado and Lambesis Studios in San Diego, California. On June 22, 2012, the album title, release date, and first single were announced. On June 25, the first single \"Cauterize\" was released for free download and became available online for purchase the following day. On June 27, a lyric video for \"Cauterize.\" The band also created an event on Facebook inviting fans to participate in a music video shoot for \"A Greater Foundation.\"\" Fans were able to pre-order a copy on the Rockstar Mayhem Festival tour of 2012. The band released clips of the album via SoundCloud prior to the release date, and on September 11, the music video for \"A Greater Foundation\" was released."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/cc/Aild_awakened-cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awakened_(album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/ff/Awakened_film_poster.jpg/250px-Awakened_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/Awakened_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/ff/Awakened_film_poster.jpg/250px-Awakened_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAwakened_film_poster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/cc/Aild_awakened-cover.jpg/250px-Aild_awakened-cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/cc/Aild_awakened-cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/cc/Aild_awakened-cover.jpg/250px-Aild_awakened-cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAild_awakened-cover.jpg"}],"sounds":{"awakened":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/En-us-awakened.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/En-us-awakened.ogg/En-us-awakened.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey heron (00129p)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg","ratio":0.8691693290734824,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_heron_(00129p).jpg","share":0.348125},{"title":"Awake